            <ArticleTitle>Neck pain in the elderly: a management review. Part I.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>59-62, 65</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Degenerative disease of the cervical spine is a common cause of neck pain in the elderly. This article reviews the pathogenesis, clinical features, and management of cervical spondylitic radiculopathy and myelopathy in the elderly.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
